  "name": {
   "zh": "面部 UV 与深度贴图 · FaceAnything",
   "en": "Face UV and Depth Map · FaceAnything"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "FaceAnything 官方自述：统一的前馈模型，从任意图像序列做高保真的 4D 面部几何与稠密跟踪，核心是给每个像素预测共享规范空间里的面部坐标。这张卡交付一套多层 EXR：UV 坐标图（uv）、面部深度贴图（depth）、规范坐标（canonical）和面部遮罩（mask）。",
   "en": "FaceAnything describes itself as a unified feed-forward model for high-fidelity 4D facial geometry and dense tracking from any image sequence, predicting for every pixel a face coordinate in a shared canonical space. This card delivers a multi-layer EXR: UV coordinates (uv), face depth (depth), canonical coordinates (canonical) and a face mask (mask)."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "face_maps",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
